      "type": "FAQs",
      "content": "<p><strong>What&nbsp;do&nbsp;WE&nbsp;sell?</strong></p><p>&nbsp;We&nbsp;sell&nbsp;pre-made&nbsp;UEFN&nbsp;maps,&nbsp;Verse&nbsp;logic&nbsp;systems,&nbsp;custom&nbsp;Fortnite&nbsp;map&nbsp;development,&nbsp;premium&nbsp;Map,&nbsp;digital&nbsp;assets.&nbsp;Custom&nbsp;Verse&nbsp;.</p><p></p><p><strong>How&nbsp;do&nbsp;I&nbsp;receive&nbsp;my&nbsp;files?</strong></p><p>&nbsp;After&nbsp;purchase,&nbsp;files&nbsp;are&nbsp;instantly&nbsp;available&nbsp;in&nbsp;your&nbsp;user&nbsp;dashboard&nbsp;for&nbsp;download&nbsp;and&nbsp;future&nbsp;re-downloads.</p><p></p><p><strong>Can&nbsp;I&nbsp;download&nbsp;again&nbsp;later?</strong></p><p>&nbsp;Yes!&nbsp;All&nbsp;purchases&nbsp;are&nbsp;saved&nbsp;to&nbsp;your&nbsp;account&nbsp;for&nbsp;future&nbsp;access.</p><p></p><p><strong>Are&nbsp;refunds&nbsp;available?</strong></p><p>&nbsp;Refunds&nbsp;are&nbsp;limited&nbsp;due&nbsp;to&nbsp;instant&nbsp;digital&nbsp;delivery.&nbsp;See&nbsp;our&nbsp;Refund&nbsp;Policy&nbsp;for&nbsp;details.</p><p></p><p><strong>Do&nbsp;you&nbsp;offer&nbsp;custom&nbsp;maps&nbsp;or&nbsp;Verse&nbsp;scripting?</strong></p><p>&nbsp;Yes!&nbsp;You&nbsp;can&nbsp;request&nbsp;custom&nbsp;maps,&nbsp;game&nbsp;modes,&nbsp;Verse&nbsp;logic,&nbsp;and&nbsp;bug&nbsp;fixes.</p><p></p><p><strong>What&nbsp;is&nbsp;Premium&nbsp;Map</strong></p><p>Premium&nbsp;map&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;map&nbsp;that&nbsp;only&nbsp;you&nbsp;will&nbsp;get&nbsp;the&nbsp;access&nbsp;of&nbsp;it.&nbsp;After&nbsp;you&nbsp;purchase&nbsp;a&nbsp;premium&nbsp;map&nbsp;we&nbsp;will&nbsp;transfer&nbsp;the&nbsp;owner&nbsp;shop&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;map&nbsp;</p><p>(Team&nbsp;invite&nbsp;require)</p><p></p><p><strong>Is&nbsp;support&nbsp;available&nbsp;24/7?</strong></p><p>&nbsp;Support&nbsp;is&nbsp;available&nbsp;24/7&nbsp;or&nbsp;during&nbsp;business&nbsp;hours&nbsp;depending&nbsp;on&nbsp;workload.</p><p></p><p><strong>Is&nbsp;payment&nbsp;secure?</strong></p><p>&nbsp;Yes.&nbsp;All&nbsp;payments&nbsp;are&nbsp;processed&nbsp;securely&nbsp;