      "type": "Privacy Policy",
      "content": "<p>Your&nbsp;privacy&nbsp;matters&nbsp;to&nbsp;us.&nbsp;This&nbsp;policy&nbsp;explains&nbsp;how&nbsp;uefnmap.com&nbsp;collects&nbsp;and&nbsp;uses&nbsp;your&nbsp;information.</p><h2>Information&nbsp;We&nbsp;Collect</h2><p>We&nbsp;may&nbsp;collect:</p><ul><li>Name</li><li>Email&nbsp;address</li><li>Purchase&nbsp;history</li><li>IP&nbsp;address&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;basic&nbsp;analytics</li></ul><p>We&nbsp;<strong>do&nbsp;not&nbsp;store&nbsp;payment&nbsp;card&nbsp;details.</strong>&nbsp;All&nbsp;payments&nbsp;are&nbsp;handled&nbsp;by&nbsp;<strong>Paddle</strong>.</p><h2>How&nbsp;We&nbsp;Use&nbsp;Your&nbsp;Information</h2><p>We&nbsp;use&nbsp;your&nbsp;data&nbsp;to:</p><ul><li>Provide&nbsp;access&nbsp;to&nbsp;your&nbsp;downloads</li><li>Manage&nbsp;your&nbsp;account</li><li>Deliver&nbsp;customer&nbsp;support</li><li>Send&nbsp;important&nbsp;updates&nbsp;about&nbsp;your&nbsp;orders</li><li>Improve&nbsp;our&nbsp;website&nbsp;and&nbsp;services</li></ul><h2>Data&nbsp;Protection</h2><p>We&nbsp;take&nbsp;reasonable&nbsp;steps&nbsp;to&nbsp;protect&nbsp;your&nbsp;information&nbsp;from&nbsp;unauthorized&nbsp;access,&nbsp;misuse,&nbsp;or&nbsp;disclosure.</p><h2>Third-Party&nbsp;Services</h2><p>We&nbsp;may&nbsp;use&nbsp;third-party&nbsp;services&nbsp;for:</p><ul><li>Payments&nbsp;(Paddle)</li><li>Website&nbsp;analytics</li><li>Customer&nbsp;support&nbsp;tools</li></ul><p>These&nbsp;services&nbsp;only&nbsp;receive&nbsp;the&nbsp;minimum&nbsp;data&nbsp;required&nbsp;to&nbsp;operate.</p><h2>Your&nbsp;Rights</h2><p>You&nbsp;may&nbsp;request:</p><ul><li>Access&nbsp;to&nbsp;your&nbsp;data</li><li>Correction&nbsp;of&nbsp;your&nbsp;data</li><li>Deletion&nbsp;of&nbsp;your&nbsp;account</li></ul><p>Contact&nbsp;us&nbsp;at:&nbsp;webuefnmap@gmail.com</p>"
    },
    {
      "_id": "699bd3621091cde7e0d51de3",
      "createdAt": "2026-02-23T04:11:14.122Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-14T08:17:07.302Z",
      "type": "Refund Policy",
      "content": "<h1>Refund&nbsp;Policy</h1><h1></h1><p><strong>Last&nbsp;Updated:&nbsp;March&nbsp;2026</strong></p><p></p><p></p><p>At&nbsp;<strong>uefnmap.com</strong>,&nbsp;we&nbsp;sell&nbsp;digital&nbsp;products&nbsp;and&nbsp;services&nbsp;for&nbsp;creators&nbsp;working&nbsp;with&nbsp;Unreal&nbsp;Editor&nbsp;for&nbsp;Fortnite&nbsp;(UEFN).&nbsp;All&nbsp;purchases&nbsp;are&nbsp;processed&nbsp;securely&nbsp;through&nbsp;<strong>Paddle</strong>,&nbsp;which&nbsp;acts&nbsp;as&nbsp;the&nbsp;merchant&nbsp;of&nbsp;record&nbsp;for&nbsp;transactions&nbsp;on&nbsp;this&nbsp;website.</p><p>Because&nbsp;our&nbsp;products&nbsp;are&nbsp;delivered&nbsp;digitally&nbsp;and&nbsp;made&nbsp;available&nbsp;instantly&nbsp;after&nbsp;purchase,&nbsp;refunds&nbsp;are&nbsp;limited&nbsp;and&nbsp;handled&nbsp;according&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;conditions&nbsp;below.</p><p></p><h2>Digital&nbsp;Products</h2><p>All&nbsp;products&nbsp;sold&nbsp;on&nbsp;uefnmap.com&nbsp;are&nbsp;<strong>digital&nbsp;downloads&nbsp;or&nbsp;digital&nbsp;content</strong>&nbsp;delivered&nbsp;through&nbsp;your&nbsp;user&nbsp;account&nbsp;dashboard.</p><p>By&nbsp;purchasing&nbsp;and&nbsp;downloading&nbsp;digital&nbsp;content&nbsp;from&nbsp;our&nbsp;website,&nbsp;you&nbsp;acknowledge&nbsp;and&nbsp;agree&nbsp;that:</p><ul><li>Delivery&nbsp;begins&nbsp;immediately&nbsp;after&nbsp;purchase.</li><li>Once&nbsp;the&nbsp;download&nbsp;or&nbsp;transmission&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;digital&nbsp;product&nbsp;has&nbsp;started,&nbsp;the&nbsp;<strong>right&nbsp;of&nbsp;withdrawal&nbsp;is&nbsp;lost</strong>&nbsp;in&nbsp;accordance&nbsp;with&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;consumer&nbsp;laws&nbsp;for&nbsp;digital&nbsp;content.</li></ul><p></p><h2>When&nbsp;Refunds&nbsp;May&nbsp;Be&nbsp;Approved</h2><p>Refund&nbsp;requests&nbsp;may&nbsp;be&nbsp;considered&nbsp;under&nbsp;the&nbsp;following&nbsp;circumstances:</p><ul><li>The&nbsp;purchased&nbsp;file&nbsp;is&nbsp;<strong>corrupted&nbsp;or&nbsp;unusable</strong></li><li>The&nbsp;product&nbsp;is&nbsp;<strong>significantly&nbsp;different&nbsp;from&nbsp;its&nbsp;description</strong></li><li>A&nbsp;<strong>technical&nbsp;issue&nbsp;prevents&nbsp;delivery</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;we&nbsp;cannot&nbsp;provide&nbsp;access&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;product</li><li>Duplicate&nbsp;payments&nbsp;were&nbsp;made&nbsp;in&nbsp;error</li></ul><p>In&nbsp;most&nbsp;cases,&nbsp;our&nbsp;team&nbsp;will&nbsp;first&nbsp;attempt&nbsp;to&nbsp;<strong>resolve&nbsp;the&nbsp;issue&nbsp;or&nbsp;provide&nbsp;a&nbsp;replacement&nbsp;file</strong>&nbsp;before&nbsp;issuing&nbsp;a&nbsp;refund.</p><p></p><p></p><h2>When&nbsp;Refunds&nbsp;Will&nbsp;Not&nbsp;Be&nbsp;Provided</h2><p>Refunds&nbsp;will&nbsp;generally&nbsp;not&nbsp;be&nbsp;granted&nbsp;if:</p><ul><li>The&nbsp;digital&nbsp;product&nbsp;has&nbsp;already&nbsp;been&nbsp;downloaded&nbsp;and&nbsp;works&nbsp;as&nbsp;described</li><li>You&nbsp;changed&nbsp;your&nbsp;mind&nbsp;after&nbsp;purchase</li><li>You&nbsp;no&nbsp;longer&nbsp;need&nbsp;the&nbsp;product</li><li>You&nbsp;do&nbsp;not&nbsp;have&nbsp;the&nbsp;required&nbsp;software&nbsp;or&nbsp;knowledge&nbsp;to&nbsp;use&nbsp;the&nbsp;product</li><li>The&nbsp;product&nbsp;was&nbsp;purchased&nbsp;by&nbsp;mistake&nbsp;but&nbsp;already&nbsp;accessed</li></ul><p></p><h2>Refund&nbsp;Requests</h2><p>If&nbsp;you&nbsp;experience&nbsp;a&nbsp;problem&nbsp;with&nbsp;your&nbsp;purchase,&nbsp;please&nbsp;contact&nbsp;our&nbsp;support&nbsp;team&nbsp;within&nbsp;<strong>14&nbsp;days&nbsp;of&nbsp;purchase</strong>.</p><p>📧&nbsp;<strong>Email:</strong>&nbsp;webuefnmap@gmail.com</p><p>Please&nbsp;include:</p><ul><li>Your&nbsp;order&nbsp;number</li><li>The&nbsp;email&nbsp;address&nbsp;used&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;purchase</li><li>A&nbsp;description&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;issue</li></ul><p></p><h2>Refund&nbsp;Processing</h2><p>Approved&nbsp;refunds&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;processed&nbsp;through&nbsp;<strong>Paddle</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;returned&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;original&nbsp;payment&nbsp;method&nbsp;used&nbsp;during&nbsp;checkout.</p><p>Refund&nbsp;processing&nbsp;times&nbsp;may&nbsp;vary&nbsp;depending&nbsp;on&nbsp;your&nbsp;payment&nbsp;provider&nbsp;or&nbsp;bank.</p><p></p><h2>Consumer&nbsp;Rights</h2><p>Nothing&nbsp;in&nbsp;this&nbsp;Refund&nbsp;Policy&nbsp;affects&nbsp;your&nbsp;statutory&nbsp;rights&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;consumer.&nbsp;If&nbsp;a&nbsp;product&nbsp;is&nbsp;faulty,&nbsp;not&nbsp;as&nbsp;described,&nbsp;or&nbsp;not&nbsp;fit&nbsp;for&nbsp;purpose,&nbsp;you&nbsp;may&nbsp;be&nbsp;entitled&nbsp;to&nbsp;remedies&nbsp;under&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;consumer&nbsp;protection&nbsp;laws.</p><p></p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For&nbsp;refund&nbsp;requests&nbsp;or&nbsp;support&nbsp;inquiries,&nbsp;please&nbsp;contact:</p><p></p><p><strong>uefnmap.com</strong></p><p>&nbsp;📧&nbsp;webuefnmap@gmail.com</p>"
    },
